{"id": "EUVD-2026-99012", "enisaUuid": "dc892eb8-5f18-315c-8b85-bf7fba8fc06b", "description": "wallabag 2.6.13 through 2.6.14 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability that allows authenticated users to host arbitrary HTML by triggering a failed Pocket HTML, Pocket CSV or Shaarli import. Attackers can upload an HTML file with script but no anchor elements, leaving it at the predictable /uploads/import/<user-id>.html path to execute script in victims' wallabag sessions.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T18:50:12", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T16:23:45", "baseScore": 5.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/wallabag-pocket-html-failed-import-stored-xss", "https://github.com/wallabag/wallabag/blob/74cbfd945bc316b5cf0308ba56e32fd2ed3443c0/src/Wallabag/ImportBundle/Controller/HtmlController.php#L28-L54", "https://github.com/wallabag/wallabag/blob/74cbfd945bc316b5cf0308ba56e32fd2ed3443c0/app/config/wallabag.yml#L169-L177", "https://github.com/wallabag/wallabag/blob/74cbfd945bc316b5cf0308ba56e32fd2ed3443c0/web/.htaccess#L50-L56", "https://github.com/wallabag/wallabag", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/wallabag-2.6.13-through-2.6.14-stored-xss-via-failed-html-import-upload"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110228", "GHSA-rqqm-gvvm-8vpc"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4010d619-25e0-32f0-820a-2d68e38301c1", "product": {"name": "wallabag", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "2.6.13 \u22642.6.14"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "78e6d4a0-8578-3dba-944c-33c0da147f57", "vendor": {"name": "wallabag"}}], "isExploited": false}